# ModulusComposer

- Extension package (`inengine/modulus-*`), not a feature module — always-on when installed.
- Own all Composer require/remove/update and constraint rewrites; never put Composer shelling in `inengine/modulus`.
- Install ≠ enable: require → discover + publish; enable only with explicit `--enable` / `modulus:enable`.
- Forget Modulus state **before** `composer remove`.
- Default constraint policy stays host `modulus.upgrades.default_constraint` (`patch` → `~x.y.z`).
- Prefer PHPDoc; update CHANGELOG on behavior changes; Pest + PHPStan + Pint green before commit.
